REM MARKPARA: marks the paragraph at the cursor, with its hard return,
REM as the block. The cursor ends at the end of the block.
Sub MAIN
AutoRestore(ON)
HideDots(OFF)
Key("^QF^N{Enter}")
Key("B{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}^QR")
Goto Start
End IfException
Key("^D")
Start: Key("^KB^QF^N{Enter}")
Key("{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}^QC^KK")
Goto Done
End IfException
Key("^D^KK")
Done:
End Sub
